<title>BAHRAIN: TABLE-BBK H1 97 net rises 14.6 percent.</title>
<headline>TABLE-BBK H1 97 net rises 14.6 percent.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-07-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>		     (million Bahraini dinars)</p>
<p> Net profit		5.5   vs    4.8</p>
<p> Operating income     12.0   vs   11.5</p>
<p> Net interest income   7.0   vs    7.1</p>
<p> Expenses		  6.6   vs    6.5</p>
<p> Shareholders' funds  82.1   vs   79.5</p>
<p> Assets		  833.7   vs  739.8</p>
<p>Full Name: Bank of Bahrain and Kuwait.</p>
<p>Note - The Bahrain-based bank is owned equally by investors and financial institutions in Bahrain and Kuwait. -- Bahrain newsroom 973-524424</p>
</text>
